OL,3,GNEWSAHousing plans on village greenbelt
OL,4,Aland approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for nearly 100 homes on greenbelt
OL,7,Fland in a Surrey village have been
OL,8,Fapproved, subject to the developer
OL,9,Fproviding funding for affordable
OL,10,Fhousing, sport and flood prevention
OL,11,Fprojects.
OL,13,FTandridge District Council (TDC)
OL,14,Fapproved outline plans for up to 85
OL,15,Fhomes on land off Redehall Road in
OL,16,FSmallfield.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
