OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHousing plans on village greenbelt
OL,4,Aland approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe developer, Chartwell Land and New
OL,7,FHomes 2 Limited, said the scheme would
OL,8,Finvolve demolishing an existing house
OL,9,Fto create access to the development,
OL,10,Fthe Local Democracy Reporting Service
OL,11,Freported.
OL,13,FThe applicant said 40% of the homes
OL,14,Fwould be affordable, with public open
OL,15,Fspace and pedestrian routes included in
OL,16,Fthe plans.
